ts/steam/apps/3265250/extras/44bf284848ca0549a8654c423c0422d6.webm?t=1749685581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265250/extras/44bf284848ca0549a8654c423c0422d6.mp4?t=1749685581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat\u00a0&amp; Driving</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Jacob caught in the crossfire, get\u202fready for explosive combat using an array of advanced weaponry in missions on foot, behind the wheel and in the air. MindsEye is a richly detailed thriller with\u202fbest-in-class cinematics\u202fand a\u202fthought-provoking story about when technology and ambition collide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265250/extras/a63dfd84e72f66821e61ce5d1eec134c.poster.avif?t=1749685581\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265250/extras/a63dfd84e72f66821e61ce5d1eec134c.webm?t=1749685581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265250/extras/a63dfd84e72f66821e61ce5d1eec134c.mp4?t=1749685581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
